flowchart TD
    S["Start here: one Settings selection"]:::start
    S -->|1: menu action| W["Reuse the titled Settings window"]
    W -->|2: existing call| K["Request key and front status"]
    K -->|3: existing call| A["Request self activation once"]
    A -->|4: discretionary result| O["macOS may grant or decline activation"]
    O -.-> F["Assessment: no evidenced API-use correction in this path"]:::finding
    F --> R["Finding survives review and integration"]
    R --> Q["Antony approved empirical design; runtime remains held"]:::hold
    Q --> E["Design activation before window ordering without a documented API violation"]
    E --> I["Both orders succeeded with file tracing; no instrument-free comparison"]
    I --> C["Finite acceptance convention approved; numerical bound still to be designed"]
    C --> P["Qualified recurrence rejects repair; unavailable evidence prevents acceptance"]
    P --> B["Every ordinary assertion must pass; success covers only the declared sample"]
    B --> D["Concrete design, review and every earned integration precede implementation or runtime"]:::hold
    classDef start fill:#19354b,color:#fff,font-weight:bold,stroke:#19354b
    classDef finding fill:#e9f0f6,color:#152a3a,stroke:#526f87
    classDef hold fill:#fff1d2,color:#322600,stroke:#866216
